# Normalise text files to LF in the repository and on checkout, on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true rewrites tracked files to CRLF and
# breaks two things at once: hooks/session-start.sh carrying CRLF dies on its first line
# (hooks.json hands the path to sh, so the shebang is never read and the trailing carriage
# return makes "set -u" a syntax error), and scripts/check.sh explicitly fails any shipped
# file that contains CRLF, so the repository would reject its own checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf
